      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": "//Syntax\r\n//data_type [] variable_name = value;\r\n\r\n\r\nString[] names = {\"Zoya\", \"Jane\", \"Doe\"};\r\nSystem.out.println(\"The first name is: \" + names[0]); // Output: The first name is: John",
