      "source": "ArrayList<String> namesList = new ArrayList<String>();\r\n\r\nnamesList.add(\"Prachi\");\r\nnamesList.add(\"Krishita\");\r\nnamesList.add(\"Zoya\");\r\n\r\nnamesList.addAll(Arrays.asList(\"surbhi\",\"humaira\",\"Gayatri\",\"pratik\"));\r\n\r\nSystem.out.println(\"The list is: \" + namesList);\r\n\r\n//this is to clear the list\r\nnamesList.clear();\r\nSystem.out.println(\"Is the list cleared? : \" + namesList.isEmpty());\r\nnamesList.\r\nSystem.out.println(\"The list is: \" + namesList); // Output: The list is: []\r\n// System.out.println(\"The list is: \" + namesList); // Output: The list is: []",
